because every week I spend hours and

00:16:45.720 --> 00:16:50.280
hours and hours

00:16:47.560 --> 00:16:53.839
trying to find something that is

00:16:50.280 --> 00:16:55.440
worth putting in front of you so that I

00:16:53.839 --> 00:16:59.240
