Maybe it'll get better over time.

00:17:30.480 --> 00:17:36.360
Nobody knows. But, your judgement and

00:17:33.480 --> 00:17:38.120
your taste and your ability to struggle

00:17:36.360 --> 00:17:40.880
through this contradiction that we're

00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:44.040
talking about, that can still help you

00:17:40.880 --> 00:17:45.520
avoid the trap and create something

00:17:44.040 --> 00:17:48.720
beautiful.

00:17:45.520 --> 00:17:51.960
Something that is entirely yours.

00:17:48.720 --> 00:17:53.920
Something that is entirely you.

