hand us playbooks that worked for

00:18:10.960 --> 00:18:14.680
others. That may or may not work for

00:18:13.480 --> 00:18:16.120
you.

00:18:14.680 --> 00:18:19.680
Here's what I learned.

00:18:16.120 --> 00:18:21.640
When I started this channel,

00:18:19.680 --> 00:18:23.400
I It wasn't working out in the

