00:20:53.120 --> 00:20:59.200
but then make your own playbook. Here's

00:20:56.960 --> 00:21:03.640
an interesting proof point. You know,

00:20:59.200 --> 00:21:06.040
the experts told me that I should

00:21:03.640 --> 00:21:07.880
say subscribe. Please subscribe and like

