What's scarce now is that very human

00:22:43.760 --> 00:22:48.040
part that we're talking about.

00:22:45.800 --> 00:22:50.520
Your judgment, your taste,

00:22:48.040 --> 00:22:53.480
your genuine authenticity, your

00:22:50.520 --> 00:22:57.160
emotions. That's how you avoid that

00:22:53.480 --> 00:23:00.200
second trap of commoditization. So,

00:22:57.160 --> 00:23:04.640
okay, you bet on yourself,

00:23:00.200 --> 00:23:07.000
you got started, you figured out how to

00:23:04.640 --> 00:23:09.720
stand out from the crowd. What's the

00:23:07.000 --> 00:23:13.680
third trap? Let's go there next. The

00:23:09.720 --> 00:23:16.520
problem is that we spend our whole life

00:23:13.680 --> 00:23:19.520
becoming good at one thing. I'm a

00:23:16.520 --> 00:23:23.200
lawyer, I'm an engineer, I'm a founder,

00:23:19.520 --> 00:23:25.960
I'm a marketer, I'm an HR

00:23:23.200 --> 00:23:28.000
